  sts_gsrglobal_PCB      LZ_PCB                   -0.013   +0.007  0.7333  0/14
  TDMI_gsrglobal_PCB     LZ_PCB                   -0.025   +0.014  0.5069  0/14
  sts_gsrglobal_DMT      FD_DMT                   -0.033   -0.003  0.6291  0/14

  TDMI_gsrglobal_DMT     FD_DMT                   -0.105   -0.003  0.0887  0/14
